carbonenginejs/format-hlsl
==========================

A pure-JavaScript reader for CCP's Tr2 compiled effect container format
(`.sm_hi` / `.sm_lo` / `.sm_depth` bodies): the permutation axes, technique
and pass tables, and per-stage constant/resource/sampler metadata that make
up one compiled Carbon/Trinity effect resource.

The container layout is CarbonEngine's, which Fenris Creations (CCP Games)
published as open source under the MIT License
(<https://github.com/carbonengine>). This reader decodes it through the shared
container codec in `src/resource/format/carbonEffect`, a JavaScript port of
`trinity/trinity/Resources/Tr2EffectRes.cpp` and the file assembly in
`trinity/shadercompiler/ShaderCompiler.cpp`. Each ported file names its Carbon
source. The layout was already known from the open-source ccpwgl project,
whose older version of this reader came before CarbonEngine was published. The
Carbon port superseded it.

No Fenris Creations (CCP Games) client software, tools or proprietary
documentation were used. No game files are included. Shader bytecode bodies are
kept as opaque bytes (`CjsShaderBytecode`). This package does not decode
DXBC/HLSL bytecode; see `format-notices/dxbc`.

